msgstr "第 %d 页，共 %d 页，%d 条记录"

msgid "%d records"
msgstr "%d 条记录"

msgid "No DNS records match the current filters."
msgstr "没有符合当前筛选条件的 DNS 记录。"

msgid "%d ms"
msgstr "%d 毫秒"

msgid "%d s"
msgstr "%d 秒"

msgid "dnsmasq logs whole seconds; sub-second times cannot be resolved"
msgstr "dnsmasq 只记录整秒，无法解析亚秒级耗时"

msgid "A query and its response are two rows, joined by the query id dnsmasq assigns. A query without a response is one that never got an answer."
msgstr "一次查询与其响应为两行，由 dnsmasq 分配的查询 ID 关联。只有查询而无响应的，表示该查询未获应答。"

msgid "Records are kept in memory and reset when the device reboots. Logging every query costs a little CPU on a busy resolver; it can be switched off under DHCP/DNS settings."
msgstr "记录保存在内存中，设备重启后清空。在繁忙的解析器上记录每次查询会带来少量 CPU 开销，可在 DHCP/DNS 设置中关闭。"

msgid "This month"
msgstr "本月"

msgid "Long-term counters need the nlbwmon package"
msgstr "长期统计需安装 nlbwmon 软件包"

msgid "The month column comes from nlbwmon, which records every stream when it closes and therefore can give a real period total. It requires the nlbwmon package; without it the column stays empty and nothing else changes."
msgstr "“本月”列来自 nlbwmon：它在每条连接关闭时记录最终字节数，因此能给出真实的周期总量。该列需要安装 nlbwmon，未安装时整列为空，其余功能不受影响。"
